<title>Colombia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/colombia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-colombia-2026-11-25T19:29:15.165Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:29:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Colombian security forces stormed a supermarket in Cartagena, freeing all 20 hostages after gunmen held them for 17 hours and killing one attacker. A car bomb exploded in a central Colombian city, injuring more than 20 people, and another car bomb hit the governor's office in Meta, with the president blaming ex-FARC rebels for the blast. The ELN carried out a drone strike on a police base, wounding three people including an infant. Violence remains high, with 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/25/colombian-forces-rescue-all-hostages-after-supermarket-siege?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/world/americas/colombia-farc-peace-deal.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckp80mjr9emyo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/25/hostages-freed-colombia-security-forces-storm-cartagena-supermarket&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBNcVN2Zzg2djN2R01WbU13YktjQVFYQTl1MzZPX3RqeWdONkJxaUtCNWNxNHBYU1FPOEx0TmhNRGNQcVVnY0VnREh0aTdjZVRuZE1fOVhBYkRsSzQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261125-colombia-security-forces-rescue-hostages-in-supermarket-siege&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPUXk2MmFURDEwYmxvTFItajUwUC1YQWVXMDNYSXh5MTBDV1A5Y1ROb1FRajhCTVZQMkh6SnRXNmJENElGOWVnLXFqSWFqLXZleTRwc2RieDFvYzRGWDRHd2ZmclFVSzk3NFN0bmI3ZkJtbHJfNV81dWtoeWEzNmVvN3dpZ0Q4dF8zVjV3WU1xOXpPMHRUVnNzMjd1REx0ZHloZ29ZWjlNajVwSS1LeTBHek9WSmE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a 